Z||000011||87ECO5||09-13-2000||09:07 PM||||Hey, Terry!  My parents live out there (pretty close to your shop, I think).  Nice place to visit but I wouldn't want to live there - too many people!<P>Hey, mrfiero! - how many Fiero shows are held in the Rockies!?    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||7
